RedirectPermanent /clubs/south-east /clubs/
RedirectPermanent /clubs/north-west /clubs/
RedirectPermanent /clubs/north-east /clubs/
RedirectPermanent /clubs/south-west /clubs/
RedirectPermanent /clubs/east-midlands /clubs/
RedirectPermanent /clubs/west-midlands /clubs/
RedirectPermanent /clubs/yorkshire /clubs/

